BT 72 720 Td 14 TL /F1 12 Tf (4 Experimental Protocol) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (Training sequences are generated by a synthetic Markov grammar with) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (controllable dependency range, so the required context length is known) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (exactly. Models are 12-layer Transformers with hidden size 768, trained at) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (context length 32768 and evaluated at lengths up to 131072. Each configuration) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (is run with three seeds, and we report the median.) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (5 Results) Tj T* /F2 10 Tf (Table 1: Perplexity drift beyond the training length \(synthetic\).) Tj T* /F2 10 Tf (Encoding                Drift at 4x     Drift at 8x) Tj T* /F2 10 Tf (Learned absolute        fails           fails) Tj T* /F2 10 Tf (Sinusoidal              18.7%           41.2%) Tj T* /F2 10 Tf (Standard rotary         6.9%            22.5%) Tj T* /F2 10 Tf (Helix-64 \(this work\)    2.1%            4.8%) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf () Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (Helix-64 is the only encoding whose drift stays in single digits at eight) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (times the training length. Learned absolute embeddings cannot be evaluated) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (beyond the training window and are marked as failing by construction.) Tj T* ET
